      "text": "信息安全技术 个人信息安全规范",
      "src": "figure",
      "role": "figure_text",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 157.62896728515625,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "1 范围",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "y": 188.53659057617188,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "本标准规定了开展收集、存储、使用、共享、转让、公开披露、删除等个人信息处",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 204.13662719726562,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "理活动应遵循的原则和安全要求。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 219.73660278320312,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "本标准适用于规范各类组织的个人信息处理活动，也适用于主管监管部门、第三方",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 235.33663940429688,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "评估机构等组织对个人信息处理活动进行监督、管理和评估。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 266.82891845703125,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "2 规范性引用文件",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "y": 297.7666320800781,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "下列文件对于本文件的应用是必不可少的。凡是注日期的引用文件，仅注日期的版",
