      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 0.5
    },
    {
      "y": 469.3866271972656,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "以电子或者其他方式记录的能够单独或者与其他信息结合识别特定自然人身份或",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 484.9866027832031,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "者反映特定自然人活动情况的各种信息。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 501.6189880371094,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "注1：个人信息包括姓名、出生日期、身份证件号码、个人生物识别信息、住址、通信通讯联系方式、",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 517.2189331054688,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "通信记录和内容、账号密码、财产信息、征信信息、行踪轨迹、住宿信息、健康生理信息、交",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 532.5971069335938,
      "size": 10.5,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "如何识别个人信息？",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 532.8189697265625,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "易信息等。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 543.0866088867188,
      "size": 10.5,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "界面、通信录、位置",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 548.1310424804688,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "注2：关于个人信息的判定方法和类型参见附录A。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 564.2259521484375,
      "size": null,
      "bold": null,
      "text": "注3：个人信息控制者通过个人信息或其他信息加工处理后形成的信息，例如，用户画像或特征标签，",
      "src": "figure",
      "role": "figure_text",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 564.2259521484375,
      "size": null,
      "bold": null,
      "text": "能够单独或者与其他信息结合识别特定自然人身份或者反映特定自然人活动情况的，属于个人",
      "src": "figure",
      "role": "figure_text",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
